  "cues": [
    {
      "start": 0.403,
      "end": 3.353,
      "text": "Kodak invented one of the world's first digital cameras."
    },
    {
      "start": 3.49,
      "end": 6.288,
      "text": "Yet decades later, the company that helped create the future"
    },
    {
      "start": 6.368,
      "end": 8.121,
      "text": "of photography filed for bankruptcy."
    },
    {
      "start": 8.626,
      "end": 11.498,
      "text": "For decades, Kodak was a giant in photography."
    },
    {
      "start": 11.646,
      "end": 13.626,
      "text": "People bought its cameras, film rolls,"
    },
    {
      "start": 13.706,
      "end": 14.931,
      "text": "and printing services."
    },
    {
      "start": 15.066,
      "end": 18.131,
      "text": "Its business was built around capturing memories on film."
    },
    {
      "start": 19.446,
      "end": 23.601000000000003,
      "text": "Then, in 1975, Kodak engineer Steven Sasson built a digital"
    },
    {
      "start": 23.681,
      "end": 27.63,
      "text": "camera prototype. It was bulky, captured tiny black-and-white images,"
    },
    {
      "start": 27.78,
      "end": 30.314,
      "text": "and took 23 seconds to record a photograph."
    },
    {
      "start": 32.469,
      "end": 36.406,
      "text": "But digital photography challenged the economics of Kodak's established film"
    },
    {
      "start": 36.486,
      "end": 37.106,
      "text": "business."
    },
    {
      "start": 37.24,
      "end": 40.473,
      "text": "The company had to navigate a difficult transition while protecting"
    },
    {
      "start": 40.553,
      "end": 42.332,
      "text": "an enormous existing business."
    },
    {
      "start": 44.469,
      "end": 48.583,
      "text": "Kodak tried multiple strategies, but its financial and competitive pressures"
    },
    {
      "start": 48.663,
      "end": 53.677,
      "text": "continued. In January 2012, the company filed for Chapter 11 bankruptcy"
    },
    {
      "start": 53.757,
      "end": 59.546,
      "text": "protection. The lesson isn't that Kodak never innovated. It did."
    },
    {
      "start": 59.7,
      "end": 62.875,
      "text": "The deeper problem was turning innovation into a sustainable business"
    },
    {
      "start": 62.955,
      "end": 66.186,
      "text": "model before the market moved beyond its traditional strengths."
    },
    {
      "start": 71.47,
      "end": 73.895,
      "text": "Because inventing the future is one thing."
    },
    {
      "start": 74.04,
      "end": 76.857,
      "text": "Building a business that can survive it is another."
    }
  ]
}
